@startuml
title PKM e-Ledger System - Transaction Entry Sequence
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #004AAD
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  ParticipantBorderColor #004AAD
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}

actor "Management User" as User
participant "Browser / Next.js UI" as UI
participant "Server Action" as Action
participant "Domain Validation" as Validation
database "Prisma" as Prisma
database "SQLite" as SQLite
participant "Attachment Storage" as Storage
participant "Audit Log" as Audit

User -> UI: Submit income, expense, or transfer form
UI -> Action: FormData + idempotency key + attachment
Action -> Validation: Parse fields and validate business input
Validation --> Action: Validated transaction command
Action -> Storage: Stage upload
Storage --> Action: Temporary storage key
Action -> Prisma: Execute idempotent command
Prisma -> SQLite: Read term, categories,\nbalances, and active entries
SQLite --> Prisma: Snapshot data
Prisma -> SQLite: Persist movement and attachment metadata
SQLite --> Prisma: Commit result
Prisma -> Audit: Append immutable audit entries
Audit --> Prisma: Audit append result
Prisma --> Action: Transaction DTO
Action -> Storage: Commit staged upload
Storage --> Action: Active storage key
Action --> UI: Revalidate ledger and redirect
UI --> User: Updated balances and ledger row

alt Validation or authorization failure
  Validation --> Action: Error details
  Action --> UI: Field or domain error
  UI --> User: Corrective message
else Transient database conflict
  Prisma -> SQLite: Retry with bounded backoff
end
@enduml
